("Fish Broth","fish-broth","Seafood","Fast, clean fish broth for chowders, seafood sauces, risotto, and soups.",["2 lb non-oily white-fish bones and heads, gills removed","1 leek","1 onion","1 celery rib","1/2 cup dry white wine","Parsley stems","1 bay leaf","2 qt water"],["Rinse fish bones thoroughly.","Sweat vegetables without browning; add bones and wine.","Add water and simmer only 20–30 minutes.","Strain immediately; do not overcook."],["fish-stock","shellfish-broth","court-bouillon"]),
